1
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,640
打扰一下 真是不好意思
Excuse me, I'm so sorry.

2
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:08,260
我从不跟名人打招呼
I never do this for celebrities.

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,360
但你是不是新视野不动产广告
But are you by any chance the foxy mom

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:12,320
里面那位性感迷人的辣妈呀
on the New Horizon realty ad.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,700
我会后悔做这个吗
Am I gonna regret doing that?

6
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,540
拍万宝路广告那个人后悔过吗
Did the marlboro man have any regrets?

7
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,200
这个广告太完美了
This ad is perfect.

8
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,720
看 我不只是在卖房子
See, I'm not just selling houses,

9
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,660
我还在宣传我自己
I'm selling myself,

10
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,160
最让我引以为傲的就是我的家庭
and the best part about me is my family.

11
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,420
还有我的牙齿
And my teeth.

12
00:00:24,776 --> 00:00:29,517
而这些 都将呈现在这则广告上
And both...are on display in this ad.

13
00:00:29,560 --> 00:00:32,000
"您满意 我满足"
"I can't be satisfied until you're satisfied"?

14
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,020
你即将在巴士候车亭看见
Coming soon to a bus bench near you,

15
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,460
更别说我们的小货车了
not to mention our minivan.

16
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,480
所以你是来真的咯
So that's really happening?

17
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:38,980
等等 我们的小货车怎么了
Wait. What's happening to our minivan?

18
00:00:39,017 --> 00:00:41,603
要被这个坏家伙贴身黏上
Having this bad boy shrink-wrapped on it.

19
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,600
-漂亮 -是啊
- Classy. - Yep.

20
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,200
现在就算你妈开车瞎晃 也能干点正事了
Now all that driving around your mom does will serve a purpose.

21
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:47,000
早上好 亲人们
Good morning, family.

22
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,960
在这个美好的日子里 你们过得怎么样
How are you all doing on this beautiful day?

23
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:50,300
很好 这是怎么回事
Okay. What's this?

24
00:00:50,331 --> 00:00:52,329
海莉的高考成绩可以在网上查询了
Haley's S.A.T. scores are available online.

25
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:53,040
我恨你
I hate you.

26
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:55,100
今天可是个大日子
Oh! ! Today's the big day.

27
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,840
我们来看看 她考的怎么样
Let's take a look, see how she did.

28
00:00:57,081 --> 00:00:59,260
我们真的要现在就看么
Do we really have to look at them now?

29
00:00:59,260 --> 00:00:59,760
不用担心
Don't worry.

30
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:01,320
我们不期望会有奇迹发生
We're not expecting any miracles.

31
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:02,280
谢谢
Thank you.

32
00:01:02,322 --> 00:01:04,623
这些是海莉的分数吗 你确定
Are those Haley's scores? Are you sure?

33
00:01:04,654 --> 00:01:06,160
为什么 很低么
Why? Are they bad?

34
00:01:06,160 --> 00:01:07,200
不 它们不低
No, they're not bad.

35
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,020
那很高吗
Are they good?

36
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:09,820
也不 中等水平
No, they're average.

37
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:12,400
亲爱的 我们成功了
Sweetie, we did it.

38
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,680
我们的孩子是中等
Our baby's average.

39
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,580
中等万岁
Medium five!

40
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,540
这只是一个偶然
This is just a fluke.

41
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:17,940
她还可以再考一次
She can take them again.

42
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,420
是的 她或许还能考得更好
Yeah, and she'll probably do even better.

43
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:20,720
到时候你就可以有
You are gonna have your choice

44
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:23,340
好几个很好的大学可供选择了
of some pretty good colleges when the time comes.

45
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:24,980
前提是我得去大学
If I go to college.

46
00:01:25,460 --> 00:01:25,820
什么
What?

47
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:27,800
我最近一直在想这个
I've been thinking about it lately,

48
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:31,029
我或许 不会去
and I might...not.

49
00:01:31,060 --> 00:01:31,540
待会见
Later!

50
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:35,000
虽然成绩出乎意料的不错
Well, we took the scenic route,

51
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,620
但烂泥终究扶不上墙
but we ended up in the same place.

52
00:01:51,626 --> 00:01:53,203
从津巴布韦到阿尔及利亚
From Zimbabwe to Algeria

53
00:01:53,203 --> 00:01:54,801
来吧 让我听到你的声音
Come on, let me hear ya

54
00:01:54,801 --> 00:01:57,280
就是这些国家了 就是这些国家了
These are the countries, these are the countries

55
00:01:57,280 --> 00:02:00,140
小卡最近成了富兰克林中学的
Cam recently became Franklin middle school's

56
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:01,860
加油 富兰克林
Go, Franklin!

57
00:02:03,660 --> 00:02:06,000
我自告奋勇为他们的春季音乐会效力
I was volunteering for their spring musical festival

58
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:10,060
突然莫名其妙的病了
suddenly and mysteriously became ill.

59
00:02:10,540 --> 00:02:11,700
对不起
Oh, sorry.

60
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:13,260
这可能是他们的福分
It may have been a blessing.

61
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,780
他们的演出没什么重点
Their show lacked focus.

62
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,620
是我为它制定了一个主题
I gave it a theme --

63
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,340
"环球音乐之旅"
"A musical trip around the world."

64
00:02:19,372 --> 00:02:21,128
是的 瞧 他的重点就是
Yeah, see, he focused it

65
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,600
把它跟世界联系起来
by making it about the world.

66
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,200
你不喜欢这个
You don't like it.

67
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,040
不 小卡 我喜欢
No -- Cam. I do.

68
00:02:26,077 --> 00:02:27,723
你认为那些孩子们
Do you -- do you think that the kids, though,

69
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:29,100
今晚就能学会吗
are gonna be able to learn it by tonight?

70
00:02:29,780 --> 00:02:30,660
我是说 或许你可以着重于
I mean, maybe you should stick

71
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:31,700
他们之前排练好的节目
with something that they already know.

72
00:02:31,780 --> 00:02:32,720
我就知道会这样
I knew this would happen.

73
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:34,760
为什么你总是要浇熄我炙热的梦想呢
Why do you have to throw a wet blanket on my dreams?

74
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,780
-我没有 -你一直都这样
- I do not. - You do it all the time.

75
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,840
你知道我是以什么告终的么 梦遗
And you know what I end up with? Wet dreams.

76
00:02:38,960 --> 00:02:40,580
这词一脱口而出我就后悔了 不要管它
I heard it as soon as I said it. Just leave it alone.

77
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,060
好的 小卡 只不过有时候
All right, well, Cam, it's just that sometimes

78
00:02:43,089 --> 00:02:46,441
你有点小小的过分热情了
you can be a little, you know, overenthusiastic.

79
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,960
我想让它变成世界上最好的演出
Is it really that big of a deal

80
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,720
这真有那么大的关系么
that I want this to be the best show in the world?

81
00:02:50,260 --> 00:02:51,540
该说的我都说了
Well, as long as you heard me.

82
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,260
站在我这一边 不要这么吹毛求疵
Be in my corner. Don't be so critical.

83
00:02:54,293 --> 00:02:56,396
你真的是这么看我的么
We-- is that really how you see me?

84
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:57,820
有时候我确实是这么看你的 米奇尔
Sometimes, yeah, I do, Mitchell.

85
00:02:57,820 --> 00:03:01,468
小卡 如果这是真的 我很抱歉
Cam, well, if -- if that's true, then I'm -- I'm sorry.

86
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:03,360
不 好的 从现在开始
No, you know, okay, from now on,

87
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:05,760
我百分百站在你那边
I am in your corner 100%.

88
00:03:05,801 --> 00:03:08,277
这首歌一定会艳惊四座
Yeah, that song is gonna knock everyone out.

89
00:03:08,308 --> 00:03:09,040
我不知道 不过
Well, I don't know, but

90
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,640
等你看了我准备的舞蹈再说吧
wait till you see the dance I have prepared.

91
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,520
舞蹈 舞蹈
A dance? A dance!

92
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:16,500
再来一些吐司么 曼尼
More toast, Manny?

93
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:17,980
你为什么不给我打电话呢 艾玛
Why won't you call me, Emma?

94
00:03:18,022 --> 00:03:19,678
再来一些吐司么 艾玛
More toast, Emma?

95
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,620
你有必要什么时候都来掺一脚么
Do you have to be on all the time?

96
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:24,060
好的 对不起 谁是艾玛
Okay, I'm sorry. Who is this Emma?

97
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,700
她是我今晚表演的同伴
She's in the show with me tonight.

98
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,420
我正在考虑追她
I'm thinking of taking a run at her.

99
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:29,140
你不该"追"女生
You don't "Take a run" at a woman.

100
00:03:29,460 --> 00:03:31,760
你得取悦她 让她觉得她是特别的
You woo her. You make her feel special.

101
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:32,940
亲爱的 看看这个
Hey, hon, take a look at this.

102
00:03:33,400 --> 00:03:34,300
这是我屁屁的照片
It's a picture of my butt.

103
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,220
你把她拿下之后
And then when you get her,

104
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,720
你就可以随心所欲了
you can tell her whatever you want.

105
00:03:38,260 --> 00:03:39,320
你为什么要这么做
Why do you do this?

106
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:41,300
只要我哥哥唐尼一打电话来
I programmed it so my butt pops up

107
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,480
我的屁屁就会跳出来
when my brother donnie calls.

108
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,700
借用屁屁来鄙视我哥 只用聪明人才会的招数呀
It's a clever way of saying my brother's an ass.

109
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:45,660
是吗
Is it?

110
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,800
他来了 淡定淡定
That's him. Compose yourselves.

111
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,340
忘了我给你们看过这张照片
Forget I showed you this picture.

112
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:50,380
我尽力
I'm trying.

113
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,920
你过得咋样 婊子养的傻儿子
How you doing, you dumb son of a bitch?

114
00:03:53,951 --> 00:03:56,860
你个老不死的 看起来你又胖了几磅
You old mick. Looks like you've put on a few pounds.

115
00:03:56,860 --> 00:03:57,360
彼此彼此
Oh, you too.

116
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,280
你是不是连你头发都给吃了
What, are you eating your hair?

117
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,300
歌洛莉亚
Oh, Gloria. Oh.

118
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,280
你怎么还在这儿
What are you still doing here?

119
00:04:02,380 --> 00:04:04,560
拿绿卡的办法多了 肯定还有更容易的
There's got to be an easier way to get a green card.

120
00:04:04,780 --> 00:04:05,440
唐尼伯伯
Hey, uncle Donnie,

121
00:04:05,580 --> 00:04:07,180
你今晚会来我的校园音乐会么
are you coming to my school concert tonight?

122
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,780
-这个嘛 -最多就一个小时
- Well... - It's an hour, tops.

123
00:04:08,780 --> 00:04:09,420
我肯定去
...wouldn't miss it.

124
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:11,300
我找不到我的电话了
Hey, you know, I think I misplaced my phone.

125
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:12,520
你能用你的手机打我的吗
Could you call me on yours?

126
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:13,740
我手机在包的最底下
My phone's at the bottom of my bag.

127
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:14,820
为什么不用你家里的电话打呢
Why don't you use your home phone?

128
00:04:14,820 --> 00:04:15,800
得了吧 这很简单
Oh, come on. It's simple.

129
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,360
你要干嘛
What are you doing?

130
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,000
我要电话
I want the phone.

131
00:04:17,035 --> 00:04:18,365
你放手怎么样
How about you let go, you --

132
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:19,640
把电话给我 唐尼
Give me the phone, Donnie!

133
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,540
你还以为你能放倒我么
You still think you can take me?!

134
00:04:21,570 --> 00:04:23,200
怎么了 你就这种水平吗
What? Is this all you got, huh?

135
00:04:23,230 --> 00:04:25,159
我要你的嘴尝尝老子拳头的滋味
I'm gonna wash your mouth out with fist.

136
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:29,620
我真不明白这种兄弟情 艾玛
I don't understand this relationship, Emma.

137
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,200
艾玛
Hey, Emma.

138
00:04:38,244 --> 00:04:40,507
做这场表演 就像是
Doing this show, it feels like

139
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:42,260
我们成为了一个小家庭 是吧
we've become like a little family, huh?

140
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:43,680
你是说你就像是我兄弟一样么
You mean like you're my brother?

141
00:04:43,747 --> 00:04:45,942
不不 不是
No. N-no, I don't.

142
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:47,140
不
Oh, no!

143
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:51,020
他们回来了 恐龙武器
They're back -- dinosaur arms!

144
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,540
现在可不是个好时候 卢克
This isn't a good time, Luke.

145
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,500
这可真是搞笑
That is hilarious.

146
00:04:54,542 --> 00:04:57,500
半人半恐龙
Half boy, half t-rex.

147
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,560
身处人兽两界之间
One foot in both worlds,

148
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:01,100
而为两界所不容
Wanted by neither.

149
00:05:02,380 --> 00:05:04,260
卢克 你把衣服撑大的方法真不错
Luke, that's a great way to stretch out a shirt.

150
00:05:04,305 --> 00:05:07,251
好了好了 休息结束了 大家伙儿
Okay, okay! Break's over, everyone!

151
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,020
让我们从头再来一遍
Let's take it from the top.

152
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:10,860
听着 因为演出时间是20分钟
Listen, we're running 20 minutes long,

153
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:12,780
所以我们要去掉宝莱坞部分继续演
So we're gonna go ahead and cut the Bollywood number.

154
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,920
我能离开了吗 我足球练习迟到了
Can I go? I'm late for soccer practice.

155
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:17,400
你知道还有谁错过了足球练习吗 德尔罗伊
You know who else missed soccer practice, Delroy?

156
00:05:17,400 --> 00:05:20,020
《吉屋出租》的演员们 而他们赢得了东尼奖
The cast of "Rent." And now they have a Tony.

157
00:05:20,220 --> 00:05:21,140
我们也有一位东尼
We have a Tony.

158
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,640
你太搞笑了
You are so funny.

159
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,460
不会吧
Seriously?

160
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:26,980
喂
Hello?

161
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:29,120
甜心 他们把车开来了吗
Hey, honey. Did they drop the van off yet?

162
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,540
刚刚开来
Yeah, a little while ago.

163
00:05:30,980 --> 00:05:31,700
看起来怎么样
How's it look?

164
00:05:31,746 --> 00:05:33,074
信不信由你
Uh, well, believe it or not,

165
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:35,260
我忍住了不去看
I have resisted the temptation to look.

166
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:37,300
海莉的事情搞得我有点头大
This whole Haley thing has got me a little preoccupied.

167
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:38,820
我们正要去吃饭
We're on our way out to lunch right now.

168
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:40,320
关于那个我有个看法
About that, I've been thinking.

169
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:41,820
大学还早着呢
College is still a ways away.

170
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:43,260
我觉得应该让海莉自己考虑
I say we leave Haley alone.

171
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,580
我们越是给她压力 她越是反抗
The more we push, the more she'll push back.

172
00:05:45,605 --> 00:05:46,382
我就是要给她压力
I'm gonna push.

173
00:05:46,440 --> 00:05:47,900
我坚决支持
And I support that.

174
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:50,620
也只有老爹能把我们的车搞得更丑
Only dad can make our minivan even lamer.

175
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:53,580
不好意思 你在搞啥
Excuse me. What are you doing?

176
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,200
我要把这车开到水库里面去
I'm driving this thing to the reservoir.

177
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:56,300
我叫你跳车 你就跳
Just jump when I say jump.

178
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,740
亲爱的 坐过去
Honey, slide over.

179
00:06:01,900 --> 00:06:04,320
靠这种蹩脚广告怎么能卖出房子
How is this stupid ad supposed to sell houses anyway?

180
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,340
你也听你爸说过
You heard your father.

181
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,600
他不只是在卖房子
He's not just selling houses...

182
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:08,480
他是在宣传我们
He's selling us.

183
00:06:09,818 --> 00:06:11,808
我的朋友会怎么想
What are my friends gonna think?

184
00:06:11,841 --> 00:06:13,467
他们会想
They are gonna think

185
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:15,120
你在帮你老爸捞钱
that you're helping your father put food on the table.

186
00:06:19,711 --> 00:06:22,880
- 椅子坏了吗 -算是吧
- Ay, is the chair broken? - Almost.

187
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,240
我那个贪便宜吃白食的哥哥
That cheap, freeloading brother of mine

188
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,740
老是对我的上好苏格兰威士忌恋恋不忘
can't keep his hands off my good Scotch,

189
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:28,140
你看 我把威士忌放那里
So, you see, I placed that Scotch there.

190
00:06:28,140 --> 00:06:30,620
只要我哥哥一屁股坐上面 椅子就会立马散架
My brother sits in this chair, goes out from under him --

191
00:06:30,620 --> 00:06:31,960
啪嗒 杰作呀
Bam! -- Masterpiece.

192
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:35,100
你就让你兄弟摔倒 把酒洒了吗
So you make your brother fall and spill his drink?

193
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:36,660
我也不想让酒跟着遭殃 但计划就是这样
Well, I don't want to jinx it, but that's the plan.

194
00:06:36,820 --> 00:06:38,200
你们俩怎么都那么小气
Why are you both so mean?

195
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:41,760
我长大的地方 兄弟互相尊敬
Where I come from, brothers respect each other.

196
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,260
所以说哥伦比亚才是"世外桃源"
That's why Colombia is such a peaceful utopia.

197
00:06:44,260 --> 00:06:45,080
两位小姐 你们好
Hello, ladies.

198
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,540
嘿 衣服不错
Hey, nice shirt.

199
00:06:46,570 --> 00:06:48,341
你去买衣服的地方有卖男人衣服吗
Do they sell men's clothes where you got that?

200
00:06:48,380 --> 00:06:50,300
有意思 因为妇女一向地位低下
That's funny because women are so inferior.

201
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:51,520
你真没品位
You got no taste.

202
00:06:51,580 --> 00:06:53,420
我专门为了梅莱尼的洗礼买的
I bought this for Melanie's baptism.

203
00:06:53,620 --> 00:06:54,160
梅莱尼是谁
Who's Melanie?

204
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:55,880
迈克的孩子 我的孙女
Michael's kid, my granddaughter.

205
00:06:56,500 --> 00:06:59,280
哦 忘了跟艾琳说我平安抵达了
Oh, I forgot to tell Irene I landed safely.

206
00:06:59,320 --> 00:06:59,660
喂
Hello?

207
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,200
你怎么能不知道
How could you not know

208
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,060
你自己的兄弟有孙女了
that your own brother had a granddaughter?

209
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:04,780
我好像知道
I probably knew.

210
00:07:04,940 --> 00:07:06,480
你怎么能连家人的事情都不记得了
How can you forget when he's family?

211
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:09,220
我有29个堂兄弟姐妹 我能一一道来
I have 29 cousins, and I know them all --

212
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,660
罗莎·玛琳娜 歌洛莉亚·玛琳娜
Rosa Marina, Gloria Maria,

213
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:13,360
-维罗妮卡·玛琳娜 何塞·维森特 -够了够了
- Veronica Maria, Jose Vicente - Okay, okay, okay.

214
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:13,880
你想说什么
What's your point?

215
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:16,640
你破坏椅子 你跟他打架
You do the chair, you do the fighting,

216
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,480
但是你们就是不了解对方
But you don't know each other.

217
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,460
悲剧啊
It's sad.

218
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,240
听着 虽然我跟我哥哥的交流方式
Look, I may not talk to my brother

219
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,440
与你和你的姐妹的不一样
the way you talk to your sisters,

220
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:25,160
但是相信我 我们有我们的友爱方式
But believe me, we're close in our own way.

221
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,380
你上次见他是什么时候
When was the last time that you saw him?

222
00:07:27,416 --> 00:07:29,485
我们见面没那么容易 因为他住在
Well, that's not easy, 'cause he lives up...

223
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,240
看吧 我想说水牛城来着
See, I want to say Buffalo.

224
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:36,960
我想说的是
All I'm saying

225
00:07:36,998 --> 00:07:39,980
多接受点教育没什么不好的
is that there's no downside to more education.

226
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:41,460
我早就知道你开车带我出来另有所图
I knew this car ride was a trap.

227
00:07:41,460 --> 00:07:42,480
看见没有
See that?

228
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:45,100
从这句话我就知道你有多聪明
That right there shows me just how smart you are.

229
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:48,060
没搞错吧 又来了
Really? Again?

230
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:49,060
怎么回事
What is going on?

231
00:07:49,086 --> 00:07:50,000
就是那个蹩脚广告
It's the stupid ad.

232
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:51,320
那些人也跑到我这边按喇叭
They're honking on my side, too.

233
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:55,080
没错 广告上就是我们
Yes, we're the people in the ad.

234
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,400
你们好
Yeah. Hi.

235
00:07:58,420 --> 00:07:59,920
大学还有另外一大好处
Another great thing about college

236
00:07:59,980 --> 00:08:01,060
完全的自由
complete independence.

237
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,680
我外面住公寓一样自由
I'd have that in an apartment.

238
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:05,980
不 你要租公寓 必须得有工作
No, because to have an apartment, you would need a job.

239
00:08:06,020 --> 00:08:07,620
知道在学校你的工作是什么吗
You want to know what your job is in college?

240
00:08:07,620 --> 00:08:10,140
上上课啦 做做作业啦
It's a little bit of class and homework.

241
00:08:10,140 --> 00:08:12,320
交许许多多的朋友啊
And it's a whole lot of new friends.

242
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,780
各种各样的体验呀
And experiences.

243
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:17,760
男孩觉得你可爱 而你确实处于可爱的青春年少
And the boys think you're cute and you are cute,

244
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:19,880
相信我 青春转瞬即逝
And, oh, trust me, that doesn't last forever.

245
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,700
打电话就是了
Call the number!

246
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:25,640
好极了
All right!

247
00:08:25,678 --> 00:08:27,642
准备好输球了吗
You in the mood to lose?

248
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,660
你哥我还没输过球呢
First time for everything.

249
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:29,760
你开球
You break.

250
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,220
工作怎么样
So, how's work?

251
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:34,060
不用着急 有钱哥 我不是来借钱的
Don't worry, moneybags. I'm not here for a loan.

252
00:08:34,060 --> 00:08:36,262
开得好
Nice break.

253
00:08:36,300 --> 00:08:37,540
好啦 全色球归你
All right, you're solids,

254
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:39,220
不过估计你得半天才能动杆子了
which you won't be able to eat in a few years.

255
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,260
好好
Right, right.

256
00:08:40,780 --> 00:08:42,360
说真的 你最近过得如何
Seriously, though, how are things going with you?

257
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,120
好得很
Swell.

258
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:45,700
我现在就在台球桌上教训一个胖子
I'm beating a fat guy at pool right now.

259
00:08:45,700 --> 00:08:47,292
唐尼 我试图和你交谈呢
Donnie, I'm trying to talk to you.

260
00:08:47,340 --> 00:08:47,700
为什么
Why?

261
00:08:47,733 --> 00:08:50,076
为什么 因为普通人都这样做吧
Why? 'cause that's what people do.

262
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:52,280
谈天说地 比如说他们的生活
Talk about things, like their lives.

263
00:08:54,126 --> 00:08:57,640
艾琳原来是下我套来着
Oh, Irene opened her big trap.

264
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,940
听着 我很好
Look, I'm fine.

265
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:00,720
我又不是要死掉了
It's not like I'm gonna die.

266
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:01,080
什么
What?

267
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:02,860
医生发现得早
Yeah, they caught it early.

268
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,540
化疗过后 现在好了
I took the treatment. I'm clear for now.

269
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,440
快点 该你了
Come on. It's your shot.

270
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,320
诊断出啥了
Caught what early?

271
00:09:08,289 --> 00:09:11,032
唐尼 你是不是说
Donnie, are you talking about...

272
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:11,520
癌症
cancer?

273
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:13,940
没什么好避讳的 我知道我得癌症了
You don't have to whisper. I know I got it.

274
00:09:14,020 --> 00:09:16,520
我的前列腺检查是医生做的
You just get your prostate checked -- by a doctor,

275
00:09:16,540 --> 00:09:17,940
又不是在网上认识的人
not some guy you met on the internet.

276
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,500
我不敢相信你居然瞒着我
I can't believe you didn't tell me this.

277
00:09:19,540 --> 00:09:20,860
这又没什么大不了的
Because it's not a big deal.

278
00:09:21,260 --> 00:09:23,700
听着 这件事就咋俩知道
Now, listen. It's just between us.

279
00:09:25,118 --> 00:09:26,604
天啊
Oh, god.

280
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:32,560
艾琳 我怎么知道你的破眼镜在哪
Irene, how the hell do I know where your glasses are?

281
00:09:39,020 --> 00:09:40,420
还有飞盘高尔夫啦
And there's frisbee golf,

282
00:09:40,420 --> 00:09:42,980
你还可以用自助餐厅的大盘子当雪橇滑雪
And -- and you go snow-sledding on cafeteria trays.

283
00:09:42,980 --> 00:09:44,500
你和室友还可以一起养条狗
Oh, and you all get a dog together.

284
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:46,660
我不知道暑假的时候是谁照顾它的
I don't really know who takes care of the dog during the summer,

285
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:47,980
反正你回去的时候它肯定在
but he's there when you get back.

286
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:49,840
有完没完 或许你应该回去念大学
Geez, maybe you should just go back to college.

287
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,760
亲爱的 如果时光能倒流我真的什么都愿意
Oh, honey, do you know what I would give to go back?

288
00:09:53,260 --> 00:09:56,460
那一刻你所有的生活都在你跟前 由你随心所欲
It's this moment when your whole life is in front of you,

289
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:59,080
太神奇了
and it's a magical time.

290
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:00,320
你绝对不会想错过的
You don't want to miss that,

291
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,000
因为光阴一去不复返
Because when it's gone, it's gone.

292
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,240
别烦 别烦
Yeah, yeah.

293
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:10,700
快点 艾丽克斯 车要开了
Come on, Alex. Bus is leaving.

294
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:12,960
老爸 你手机震个不停
Dad, your phone's been buzzing like crazy.

295
00:10:12,989 --> 00:10:15,644
我滴个乖乖
Sweet lorna doone!

296
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:17,060
十九个未接来电
19 missed calls?

297
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,000
到底是谁...
I wonder who's --

298
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:20,560
菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

299
00:10:22,220 --> 00:10:23,720
你看过那个广告啊
You saw the ad?

300
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:24,940
太好了
Great.

301
00:10:25,340 --> 00:10:26,580
你想找什么样的
Do you know what you're looking for?

302
00:10:27,180 --> 00:10:28,320
小的那个吗
The little one?

303
00:10:28,380 --> 00:10:29,980
我明白你说的是哪个
I think I know which one you're talking about.

304
00:10:30,007 --> 00:10:30,960
要是你感兴趣的话
Um, if you're interested,

305
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:33,220
我有个品质尚佳的老款
I also have an older model with a lot of character.

306
00:10:33,983 --> 00:10:35,140
什么
What?

307
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:36,900
我觉得地毯和窗帘很配啊
I think the carpet matches the drapes.

308
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:39,280
我有段时间没看过了
I haven't checked in a while.

309
00:10:39,700 --> 00:10:40,460
两个都想要啊
Both of them?

310
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:41,320
天啊
Wow.

311
00:10:42,260 --> 00:10:44,840
要是你打算要一个的话 我还能理解
Well, I guess that makes sense if you're planning to flip one.

312
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:47,140
这样吧 我等会回你好吧
Listen, um, why don't I call you back?

313
00:10:47,140 --> 00:10:48,200
我们约个时间
We'll set up an appointment.

314
00:10:48,260 --> 00:10:50,280
我会抓紧时间把它们都清洗干净
It'll give me a chance to give them both a good scrubbing.

315
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,200
行
All right.

316
00:10:53,020 --> 00:10:53,840
非常感谢
Thanks a lot.

317
00:10:53,878 --> 00:10:55,269
再见
Bye-bye.

318
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,220
不错吧
How about that, huh?

319
00:10:57,220 --> 00:10:58,860
你看这些电话都是问那个广告的
You think all these calls are about the ad?

320
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:00,240
是啊
Yeah.

321
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,980
我朋友妮可刚把咱们家小货车的照片发给我
My friend Nicole just sent me a picture of the van.

322
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,800
我觉得你老妈要
I guess I'll be seeing you wednesdays

323
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,720
气得跟我离婚了
and every other weekend.

324
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:10,420
你好
Hello?

325
00:11:11,300 --> 00:11:13,480
这样的 听上去你很生气
Okay, um, you sound very angry,

326
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,980
这我完全理解
which is completely understandable.

327
00:11:15,220 --> 00:11:15,880
我没生气
I'm not angry.

328
00:11:16,060 --> 00:11:18,000
我只是坐在这里 回想我的大学生涯
I'm just sitting here thinking about college

329
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,600
回忆曾经的青春年少
and how life has passed me by.

330
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,600
谢天谢地 我们表演会上见
Oh, thank god. I'll see you at the show.

331
00:11:21,628 --> 00:11:22,994
爱你 拜拜 快走
Love you. Bye. We got to go.

332
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,700
音乐到达高潮的时候
And as the music swells,

333
00:11:26,722 --> 00:11:28,160
我们举起手里的字母
we reveal our letters

334
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:29,700
拼成"我们爱世界"
spelling "We love the world."

335
00:11:30,580 --> 00:11:31,580
很好很强大
Powerful stuff.

336
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,680
然后宏伟的富兰克林中学的标志
And then the majestic Franklin middle school insignia

337
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,340
就会缓缓就位
will drop into position

338
00:11:36,390 --> 00:11:40,119
不过前提是鲁本能把标志画完
if Reuben ever finishes painting it.

339
00:11:40,157 --> 00:11:41,823
这不是艺术殿堂 鲁本
It's not the sistine chapel, Reuben.

340
00:11:41,860 --> 00:11:43,420
惊喜吧
Surprise! Hey!

341
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,980
鼎力支持的男友顺路带点心给你吃啦
Your supportive boyfriend dropped by to bring you a snack.

342
00:11:47,336 --> 00:11:48,413
梨梨 小布里和肉肉
P.B. And J.

343
00:11:48,413 --> 00:11:50,400
梨子 布里干酪配火腿 我最爱啊
Pear, brie, and jambon. My favorite!

344
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,300
同志们 休息五分钟
Okay, people, let's take five.

345
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,320
就五分钟哦
A true five.

346
00:11:54,900 --> 00:11:56,300
曼尼 怎么样啊
Hey, Manny. How's it going?

347
00:11:56,740 --> 00:11:58,680
好 很好 好得不能再好了
Good, great, couldn't be better.

348
00:11:58,940 --> 00:12:01,380
我们能不能...
Can we, uh...

349
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:04,180
行 当然 没问题
Yes, we can, uh -- all right.

350
00:12:05,440 --> 00:12:05,920
怎么了
What's up?

351
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,599
听着 你需要跟小卡谈谈
Okay, you got to talk to Cam.

352
00:12:07,640 --> 00:12:09,020
他要把我们逼疯了
He's driving us crazy.

353
00:12:09,067 --> 00:12:11,145
凯文又开始咬指甲了
Kevin is biting his nails again,

354
00:12:11,180 --> 00:12:13,460
鲁本一周都没有拉便便了
And Reuben hasn't had a bowel movement in a week.

355
00:12:13,800 --> 00:12:16,040
别笑 猫王就是被逼死的
Don't laugh. That's how Elvis died.

356
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,220
好吧 曼尼
All right, um, Manny,

357
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:19,476
我...我不能参与进去的
I-I can't get involved.

358
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:21,720
但 好吧 要是你想反映情况
But, all right, if you have to say something,

359
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:24,740
就去告诉犀利哥 说他做过头了
just tell Bob Fussy that he's overdoing it

360
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:25,880
告诉他你们想回到原来那样
and you want to go back to your old stuff.

361
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,540
好了 休息结束 同志们
Okay, break's over, people!

362
00:12:27,540 --> 00:12:30,140
我们再来次法国大革命那一段
I want to do the french revolution number again.

363
00:12:30,180 --> 00:12:31,660
我们把断头台拿上来
Let's bring out the guillotine.

364
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:33,500
这次用点心了
Carefully this time.

365
00:12:33,880 --> 00:12:35,400
不要 不要 不要了
No, no, no.

366
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:36,160
什么
Excuse me?

367
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:39,420
我们不想做这个新玩意
We don't want to do the new stuff.

368
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,720
我们不想继续排练
We want to stop rehearsing

369
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,880
想用原来的方式演绎 犀利哥
and go back to the old way, Bob Fussy.

370
00:12:43,923 --> 00:12:46,833
我 我不知道那词哪来的
I-I don't know where this is coming from.

371
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:50,380
你们都这么认为吗
You all feel this way?

372
00:12:50,414 --> 00:12:52,495
是的 是的 是的 是的
Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.

373
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:53,900
行了 我不知道
Well, I had no idea.

374
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:59,700
我不知道我周围是一群懒人
I had no idea I was surrounded by a bunch of quitters.

375
00:13:00,020 --> 00:13:02,100
要不是我把音乐剧大师
This production was a joke

376
00:13:02,100 --> 00:13:03,720
伯恩斯坦和桑坦介绍给孩子们
until I introduced these children

377
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,480
这个破音乐剧
to the musical-theater greats --

378
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,620
还只是个大笑柄
Bernstein, Sondheim.

379
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:07,900
几年后 有个别孩子就会谈论
Years from now, some of these kids

380
00:13:07,900 --> 00:13:10,120
当初我如何将他们桑坦化的
will still be talking about the way I sondheim-ized them.

381
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:13,260
我觉得那样说不太好...好吧
Ooh, I'm don't think that's a good way of saying -- okay.

382
00:13:13,260 --> 00:13:14,340
你想用原来的方式吗
You want to do it the old way

383
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:17,520
用这首没新意老歌和死气沉沉的编舞
with the same tired songs, the same drab choreography,

384
00:13:17,620 --> 00:13:19,480
然后得到父母敷衍的欢呼吗
the same tepid applause from mom and dad?

385
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:21,740
你们真的想吗 回答我
Is that what you want? Just say the word.

386
00:13:21,740 --> 00:13:22,500
我们就是那样想的 是的 是的
That's what we want. Yes. Yes.

387
00:13:22,500 --> 00:13:23,820
行了 伙计们 很遗憾
Well, too bad, people!

388
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:25,920
我说了算 重来
We're doing it my way! From the top!

389
00:13:26,158 --> 00:13:28,162
这是封闭式彩排 闪开
This is a closed rehearsal. March.

390
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,300
亲爱的 你在外面干什么
Hi, honey. What are you doing out here?

391
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:36,593
等你啊 因为我爱你
Oh, just waiting for you 'cause I love you.

392
00:13:36,698 --> 00:13:38,008
海莉 从这边下来
Haley, come out this side.

393
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:38,440
为什么
Why?

394
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,604
因为很好玩啊 试试
'Cause it's fun. Try it.

395
00:13:42,729 --> 00:13:44,777
滑动门 移动坐垫
Yeah, the doors slide, the seats slide.

396
00:13:44,820 --> 00:13:45,920
这车无所不能啊
What can't the sienna do?

397
00:13:45,956 --> 00:13:47,072
真搞笑
That was fun.

398
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:48,480
是吗 去看表演吧
Right? Let's go see a show!

399
00:13:48,515 --> 00:13:49,933
亲爱的 我们应该把门关上
Sweetie, we need to close the door.

400
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,760
是的 用钥匙就行
Yeah, with the key.

401
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:52,460
我想看看走多远
I like to see how far I can get from the car

402
00:13:52,460 --> 00:13:53,420
还能控制这车
and still make it work.

403
00:13:53,740 --> 00:13:54,560
听着 亲爱的 亲爱的
Listen, honey, honey.

404
00:13:54,604 --> 00:13:56,347
-怎么 -我要问你些事
- Yeah? - Let me ask you something.

405
00:13:56,380 --> 00:13:58,160
你要实话实说
Okay, I need you to be really honest with me.

406
00:13:58,190 --> 00:14:01,320
行啊 你可...行
Yeah, you ca-- yes.

407
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,880
我是不是人老珠黄了
Are my best years behind me?

408
00:14:03,040 --> 00:14:03,460
说什么啊
What?

409
00:14:04,440 --> 00:14:04,860
当然不是
No.

410
00:14:05,420 --> 00:14:08,160
秘诀就是向前看
The trick is to keep looking forward.

411
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,320
走吧
Here we go.

412
00:14:09,337 --> 00:14:09,883
真的吗
Really?

413
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:11,580
是的是的 千真万确
Yes, yes, for sure.

414
00:14:11,645 --> 00:14:13,271
好些没
You feel good?

415
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:15,580
是啊 我...
Yeah, I...

416
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:20,640
大家好 欢迎各位
Hello, and welcome, everyone.

417
00:14:20,640 --> 00:14:21,820
以及迟到的人们
And latecomers.

418
00:14:22,140 --> 00:14:23,540
希望大家能喜欢今晚的表演
I hope you enjoy the show tonight.

419
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:26,080
你们一定赞同这个舞台已经多年
I think you will agree it has a certain flair

420
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:28,700
没有高水准高质量的表演了吧
that has been lacking from this stage in years past.

421
00:14:29,060 --> 00:14:32,440
所以 请容许我邀您坐稳当 放轻松
So, please, I invite you to sit back, relax,

422
00:14:32,820 --> 00:14:37,840
尽情享受这趟世界音乐旅程吧
and enjoy this musical trip around the world!

423
00:14:44,060 --> 00:14:44,620
天呐
Wow.

424
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:47,220
在美国长大是很不错
Growing up in America sure is great,

425
00:14:47,220 --> 00:14:49,620
但我还想对世界了解的更多
but I wish I knew more about the world.

426
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:50,540
我也是
Me too.

427
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:52,240
我有个主意
I think I've got an idea.

428
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:53,880
待会见 朋友
See you later, friend.

429
00:14:54,940 --> 00:14:56,320
你去哪里
Where are you going?

430
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:58,760
去见见世界
To see the world!

431
00:14:59,880 --> 00:15:01,480
中国看上去很有趣
China looks interesting.

432
00:15:01,760 --> 00:15:03,380
我就在这里着陆吧
I think I'll land here.

433
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:04,480
放他下来
Bring him down!

434
00:15:06,160 --> 00:15:06,940
放他下来
Bring him down!

435
00:15:08,550 --> 00:15:10,665
继续 继续演
Just go with it. Go with it.

436
00:15:15,294 --> 00:15:16,540
天啊 搞什么啊
Oh. Hey. Come on.

437
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,540
天啊 搞什么呀
Geez, come on,

438
00:15:17,540 --> 00:15:18,650
杰 你在剧院里呢
Jay. You're in the theater.

439
00:15:18,650 --> 00:15:19,607
看看你夹克的口袋
Try your jacket pocket.

440
00:15:19,607 --> 00:15:20,276
不好意思伙计们
Sorry, folks.

441
00:15:20,276 --> 00:15:21,920
厉害 他用胶带把手机封死了
Nice. He taped it shut.

442
00:15:21,920 --> 00:15:23,220
行了 别闹了
Okay, that's enough.

443
00:15:26,481 --> 00:15:28,940
傻子啊 你也是
Ay! Stupid! You too!

444
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:29,920
别打他 他得癌症了
Don't hit him. He has cancer.

445
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:30,300
什么
What --

446
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:40,760
天啊 卢克是被卡在那儿了吗
Oh, my god, is Luke stuck up there?

447
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,660
菲尔
Phil?

448
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:45,240
拜托
Come on.

449
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:47,200
没错儿
Yeah.

450
00:15:47,246 --> 00:15:49,239
对-- 别 哦不
Ye-- oh, no.

451
00:15:49,300 --> 00:15:50,200
拜托
Come on!

452
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,660
中国是挺有意思的
China sure was fun.

453
00:15:52,694 --> 00:15:56,486
不过看啊 那儿还有快乐的老英格兰
and look, there's merry old England.

454
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:58,400
难道看表演的人都没见过地球仪吗
Has anyone here ever seen a globe?

455
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,280
全速前进
Full steam ahead!

456
00:16:00,338 --> 00:16:04,562
是前进
Ahead!

457
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:05,520
别管那个了 你就唱吧
Just sing.

458
00:16:05,549 --> 00:16:08,137
哦 睁开被海风吹拂的眼睛
Oh, joy to salt-swept eyes

459
00:16:08,137 --> 00:16:10,772
我欣喜地看见了 那美丽的英格兰
Fair England, do I see

460
00:16:18,420 --> 00:16:21,100
抱歉我告诉了歌洛莉亚
Sorry about what I said to Gloria, okay?

461
00:16:21,940 --> 00:16:22,660
就是一时脱口而出了
Just came out.

462
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:24,200
咱们进去吧
Let's go back inside.

463
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,580
-打我一下 -什么
- Hit me. - What?

464
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:27,800
你听见我说的了 打我一下
You heard me. Hit me.

465
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:29,240
我不会打你的 唐尼
I'm not gonna hit you, Donnie.

466
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:31,160
没错 这就是重点
Yeah, well, that's the whole damn point.

467
00:16:31,420 --> 00:16:33,120
你一听说我病了
As soon as you heard I was sick,

468
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,180
你对待我的方式就不一样了
you treated me different.

469
00:16:34,216 --> 00:16:36,693
我告诉你吧 那些我在家就受够了
Let me tell you, I get enough of that at home.

470
00:16:36,980 --> 00:16:37,840
对不起
I'm sorry.

471
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:40,740
我就是有点儿替你难过 行吗
I feel a little bad for you, okay?

472
00:16:42,190 --> 00:16:45,839
我知道我们不常说这些 可是...
I know we don't say this much, but, uh...

473
00:16:45,880 --> 00:16:47,500
我是关心你的 你知道吗
I care for you, you know?

474
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:51,340
你以为我不知道这点屁事儿吗
Do you think I don't know that crap?

475
00:16:51,560 --> 00:16:53,940
自从我八岁你十岁那年
I have known you cared about me

476
00:16:53,969 --> 00:16:56,030
那个蠢货乔伊·可列里偷了我的自行车
since we were 8 and 10 years old

477
00:16:56,069 --> 00:16:59,141
你把他的头埋进冰里之后
and that mook Joey Calieri stole my bike

478
00:16:59,180 --> 00:17:00,740
我就知道你是关心我的
and you put his head in the ice.

479
00:17:03,860 --> 00:17:05,340
他当时说什么来着
What was that he said again?

480
00:17:05,372 --> 00:17:07,912
"我再也听不见了"
Um, "I can't hear no more."

481
00:17:10,420 --> 00:17:12,240
"我再也听不见了"
"I can't hear no more!"

482
00:17:12,272 --> 00:17:13,497
唐
oh, Don.

483
00:17:13,959 --> 00:17:16,000
你的舞台装饰被弄得到处都是
Your stage is all over the place.

484
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:16,900
孩子们都累疯了
The kids are exhausted.

485
00:17:17,060 --> 00:17:18,240
你就在那儿照自己的意思演
You're making all about you.

486
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:18,840
连幕间休息都没有
No intermission.

487
00:17:19,120 --> 00:17:20,040
你把我们当动物了是吗
What, are we animals?

488
00:17:20,069 --> 00:17:21,171
我...
I --

489
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,600
我会好的
I'm gonna be fine.

490
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,320
我有很好的医生
I got great doctors.

491
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:31,920
孩子们每天都给我打电话
The kids call me every day.

492
00:17:32,140 --> 00:17:34,480
艾琳因为压力过大 还瘦了20磅呢
Irene even lost 20 pounds due to stress.

493
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:35,540
真不错
Good for you.

494
00:17:37,195 --> 00:17:39,946
你答应我你会好好做个肝区检查
You promise me you'll get that liver checked out.

495
00:17:39,946 --> 00:17:41,875
哎呀 根本没--
Ah, there's nothing wrong--

496
00:17:43,035 --> 00:17:44,479
拜托 唐 您老就忍着点吧
Come on, Donna. Suck it up.

497
00:17:44,521 --> 00:17:46,028
我们都错过我儿子的演出了
We're missing my kid's show.

498
00:17:46,060 --> 00:17:47,540
你这混蛋
You son of a bitch.

499
00:17:47,580 --> 00:17:49,290
来吧来吧
Come on. Come on.

500
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:51,300
"我再也听不见啦"
"I can't hear no more!"

501
00:17:53,540 --> 00:17:54,900
好了好了
Okay, all right.

502
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:55,820
刚才那个是我的错
That one was my fault,

503
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:57,500
不过圣女贞德会没事儿的
But Joan of Arc's gonna be just fine.

504
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:59,880
这剧没了艾玛就没意思了
It's not gonna be much fun doing the show without Emma.

505
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:01,560
也许我们应该到此为止
Maybe we should just stop this.

506
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:04,180
别 不行 在戏剧界有句俗话叫
No. No. There is a saying in the theater world that --

507
00:18:04,180 --> 00:18:05,380
"为它丧命实属不智"吗
"It's not worth dying for"?

508
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,040
不 是"结尾成就一切"
No, it's that "Endings make shows."

509
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,460
再说我们那个结尾那么好
And we've got a great ending.

510
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:10,800
所以现在赶紧出去给我充满感情地唱
Now get out there and sing your hearts out.

511
00:18:10,828 --> 00:18:13,263
亲爱的你就别唱了 你对口型就行了
Oh, not you, sweetie. You just mouth the words. Okay.

512
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:15,680
小卡叔叔 我两条腿都疼了
Uncle Cam, both my legs are tingly.

513
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:17,720
卢克 我们马上就把你放下来行吗
Okay, we'll cut you down in just a second, Luke, okay?

514
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:19,440
演出得继续 要乐在其中哦
The show must go on. Have fun with it.

515
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:23,920
了解这个世界的确很有趣
Learning about the world sure was fun.

516
00:18:24,060 --> 00:18:27,100
但是能够重新两脚着地 我也挺高兴的
But I'm glad to have my feet back on the ground again.

517
00:18:27,140 --> 00:18:31,011
埃及土地 金字塔耸立
Oh, Egypt is a land where the pyramids stand

518
00:18:31,011 --> 00:18:34,378
勤劳的犹太人 把它们全部建起
Which were built by industrious jews

519
00:18:34,378 --> 00:18:39,000
风车们在荷兰的村庄 随处可见
And windmills go around in Holland town

520
00:18:39,148 --> 00:18:42,041
那里的人们 都穿着木头做的鞋
Where they all wear wooden shoes

521
00:18:42,960 --> 00:18:46,772
我们学了很多东西 在今天这一天
These are the things we learned today

522
00:18:46,930 --> 00:18:52,164
千言万语 只剩一句
And there's one last thing we want to say

523
00:18:54,840 --> 00:18:57,680
"我们爱这个词"
"We love the word"

524
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:58,900
怎么少一个字母
Where's the "L"?

525
00:18:58,946 --> 00:19:01,158
应该是卢克拿着
That's luke.

526
00:19:01,204 --> 00:19:02,499
把那个标志牌放低点儿
Lower the insignia.

527
00:19:02,533 --> 00:19:03,908
低点儿
Lower it.

528
00:19:03,989 --> 00:19:05,020
我们爱...
"We love the --"

529
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,200
搞什么啊
What the hell?

530
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:10,060
不 不对 不是 不 不
No, no, no. No, no.

531
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:11,740
不 不 不
No, no, no.

532
00:19:11,800 --> 00:19:15,720
不 不 不 不 不
No. No, no, no. No.

533
00:19:18,543 --> 00:19:20,313
太精彩了
Brava!

534
00:19:20,340 --> 00:19:21,980
菲尔 你去哪儿了
Phil, where have you been?

535
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,480
就是呼吸点儿新鲜空气
Oh, just getting some fresh air.

536
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:24,840
-亲爱的 -呼吸完了
- Honey. - Got it.

537
00:19:24,840 --> 00:19:26,420
要走了吗 嘿 看看月亮吧
Ready to go? Hey, look up at the moon.

538
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:28,120
你说这是满月呢 还是弦月呢
Would you say that's waxing or waning?

539
00:19:28,157 --> 00:19:30,383
管他呢 我们能花一晚上看
Who cares? We can spend all night looking --

540
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:31,900
"我不能被满足"
"I can't be satisfied"?!

541
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:33,940
我的天啊 菲尔
My God, Phil.

542
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:35,960
这话让我看起来跟个妓女一样
That makes me look like a prostitute.

543
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:36,400
没有
No.

544
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:37,960
有 就有
Yes. Yes, it does.

545
00:19:38,120 --> 00:19:39,540
其实更像个三陪
More of an escort, really.

546
00:19:39,620 --> 00:19:40,920
三陪的只是出卖时间而已
You're just selling your time.

547
00:19:40,953 --> 00:19:42,435
-但是妓女是-- -行了菲尔
- Whereas a prostitute just-- - Okay, Phil.

548
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:45,460
我今天一整天都开着这车跑来跑去
I have been driving around in this all day.

549
00:19:46,020 --> 00:19:48,820
好吧 既然你已经生气了
Well, since you're mad already,

550
00:19:49,780 --> 00:19:51,280
为什么你不到这边来
why don't you just step over here

551
