It doesn't matter! I'll go home with anyone!

556
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,640
这话才应该写在车上呢
That's what it should say on the van.

557
00:20:02,020 --> 00:20:02,440
艾丽克斯
Alex.

558
00:20:04,240 --> 00:20:05,480
