And they...ask for me?

576
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,680
他们要那个金发辣妹
They asked for the hot blonde.

577
00:20:37,721 --> 00:20:41,089
男人都是色情狂
Hmm. Men are pigs.

578
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:42,600
除了金发辣妹 他们还叫我什么了
Did they call me anything else?

579
00:20:42,600 --> 00:20:45,260
所以 谢谢城里的所有变态
So, thanks to all the perverts in town,

580
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:47,700
我发现我的青春年华还剩好几年呢
I realized I still have a few good years ahead of me.

581
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:51,420
如果我们为此要感谢谁的话
And if we have one person to thank for that,

582
00:20:51,700 --> 00:20:52,520
那肯定是我了
It would be me.

583
00:20:52,549 --> 00:20:53,851
少来
No.

584
00:21:03,860 --> 00:21:05,960
演出和我想的一样烂吗
Was it as awful as I think?

585
00:21:06,400 --> 00:21:07,680
收下这花儿吧
Take the flowers.

586
00:21:09,140 --> 00:21:11,260
让你在我像个傻子一样出尽洋相的时候
It must have been really hard for you to be supportive

587
