还那么支持我一定很难
while I made a fool out of myself.

588
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:14,700
来抱抱吧
Oh, come here.

589
00:21:19,260 --> 00:21:19,940
卢克 你能不能安静点儿
Luke, do you mind?

590
00:21:20,080 --> 00:21:21,180
我们正浓情蜜意呢
We're trying to have a moment here.

591
00:21:21,226 --> 00:21:24,034
我的眼睛都能感觉到心跳了
I can feel my heartbeat in my eyes.

592
